  "zh": "# 中美元首会晤引全球关注，科技与民生热点交织呈现多维发展态势\n## 国际视野\n- **习近平访美难忘瞬间意义深远**：元首会晤透露合作新意，标志中美关系进入关键窗口期。\n- **中国选手刷新36年纪录**：运动员打破长期纪录，展现我国竞技实力提升引发全国热议。\n## AI与科技\n- **Claude刷新物理学世界纪录**：AI模型在物理领域取得突破，预示科学研究范式可能被重塑。\n- **DeepSeek DSec弹性计算**：新型弹性计算架构发布，有望降低AI训练成本并提升资源调度效率。\n## 社会民生\n- **特斯拉降价两次惹怒新车主**：频繁降价引发早买车主不满，凸显新能源车市场价格波动风险。\n- **三大运营商暂停零元购机**：运营商集体停零元购机，反映市场补贴退坡及5G普及阶段调整。",
  "en": "# US-China summit draws global focus as tech advances and social issues dominate today's headlines\n## International\n- **Xi Jinping US visit memorable moments**：Summit reveals new cooperation signals, marking a critical window for China‑US relations.\n- **Chinese athlete breaks 36‑year record**：Athlete shuts down longstanding record, showcasing China’s rising competitive strength and sparking nationwide discussion.\n## AI & Tech\n- **Claude sets new physics world record**：AI model achieves breakthrough in physics, hinting at a possible reshaping of scientific research paradigms.\n- **DeepSeek DSec elastic computing launched**：New elastic computing architecture unveiled, poised to cut AI training costs and improve resource scheduling efficiency.\n## Society\n- **Tesla price cuts twice anger new buyers**：Frequent price reductions upset early purchasers, highlighting pricing volatility risks in the EV market.\n- **Carriers halt zero‑yuan phone subsidies**：Major telcos stop zero‑yuan phone deals, reflecting subsidy withdrawal and adjustments in the 5G adoption phase."
